---
import TerminalDemo from "../components/TerminalDemo";
import "../styles/global.css";

const GITHUB_URL = "https://github.com/sharadregoti/sshire";
const DEMO_CMD = "ssh -p 2222 jobs.sharadregoti.com";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>sshire — apply to jobs over SSH</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="An open-source careers page that runs as an SSH server. Candidates ssh in and apply from a terminal. Try the live demo."
    />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen font-sans antialiased">
    <main class="mx-auto flex max-w-3xl flex-col items-center gap-16 px-4 py-20 text-center sm:py-28">
      <section class="flex flex-col items-center gap-6">
        <p class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--dim)]">$ whoami</p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-6xl">sshire</h1>
        <p class="max-w-xl text-lg text-[var(--dim)] sm:text-xl">
          A careers page you ssh into instead of loading.
        </p>
        <div class="w-full max-w-md rounded-md border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--card)] px-4 py-3 text-left font-mono text-sm">
          <span class="text-[var(--dim)]">$ </span>{DEMO_CMD}
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="flex w-full flex-col items-center gap-6">
        <TerminalDemo client:visible />
        <p class="max-w-md text-sm text-[var(--dim)]">
          Screens captured from a real session. Switch themes or jump between screens below.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col items-start gap-4 text-left">
        <h2 class="font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-[var(--dim)]">Why SSH instead of a form?</h2>
        <p class="text-[var(--fg)]">
          Scrapers go looking for a form to fill in or an endpoint to POST to. There isn't one.
          sshire is a terminal program sitting behind an SSH server, and it won't even start unless
          your client asks for a real terminal:
        </p>
        <div class="w-full rounded-md border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--card)] px-4 py-3 font-mono text-sm">
          <p><span class="text-[var(--dim)]">$ </span>ssh -o BatchMode=yes jobs.sharadregoti.com</p>
          <p class="text-[#ff8a80]">Requires an active PTY</p>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[var(--fg)]">
          That stops the spray-and-pray tools. Anything running in a real terminal still gets
          through, so treat it as a speed bump rather than a security control.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col items-start gap-4 text-left">
        <h2 class="font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-[var(--dim)]">Themes</h2>
        <p class="text-[var(--fg)]">
          Five themes ship with it. Pick one in your config and that's what candidates see:
        </p>
        <div class="w-full rounded-md border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--card)] px-4 py-3 font-mono text-sm">
          <p><span class="text-[var(--dim)]">ui:</span></p>
          <p><span class="text-[var(--dim)]">&nbsp;&nbsp;theme:</span> "phosphor"</p>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[var(--fg)]">Try them on the demo above.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col items-center gap-4">
        <h2 class="font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-[var(--dim)]">Try it yourself</h2>
        <div class="w-full max-w-md rounded-md border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--card)] px-4 py-3 text-left font-mono text-sm">
          <span class="text-[var(--dim)]">$ </span>{DEMO_CMD}
        </div>
        <p class="text-[var(--fg)]">
          MIT licensed. Running your own takes a YAML file with your jobs in it and a DNS record
          pointed at your server.
        </p>
        <a
          href={GITHUB_URL}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="rounded-md border border-[var(--accent)] px-5 py-2 font-mono text-sm text-[var(--accent)] transition hover:bg-[var(--accent)] hover:text-[#01130a]"
        >
          View on GitHub →
        </a>
      </section>

      <footer class="pt-8 text-xs text-[var(--dim)]">
        <p>MIT License · Built by <a class="underline decoration-[var(--rule)] underline-offset-4 hover:text-[var(--accent)]" href="https://github.com/sharadregoti" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Sharad Regoti</a></p>
      </footer>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
